      <div class="client-slot" data-reveal><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Chera Home Junction"></div>
      <div class="client-slot" data-reveal><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="naga"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pad light-alt" id="founders">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="founders-card glass" data-reveal>
      <div class="founders-photo"><img class="imgcover" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Feroz Khan and Benaz Khan, Crowd9 founders"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Leadership</div>
        <h3>Run by people who've done the work.</h3>
        <p>Co-founders <b>Feroz Khan</b> and <b>Benaz Khan</b> bring 18+ years in media, built on creativity, collaboration, and understanding what makes communication connect.</p>
        <div class="founder-tags"><span>Feroz Khan — Founder</span><span>Benaz Khan — Co-Founder</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pad" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal><div class="eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2>Questions we get asked</h2></div>
    <div class="faq-card glass" data-reveal>
      <div class="faq-item open">
        <button class="faq-q"><span>What makes Crowd9 different?</span><span class="plus">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>We run events, film, media planning, and design under one team — nothing gets lost between vendors.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q"><span>Do you work with startups and large brands alike?</span><span class="plus">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Yes — our list spans national banks and FMCG brands alongside regional retail and hospitality businesses.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q"><span>What's your process, brief to delivery?</span><span class="plus">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>We pull the brief apart with the client, assign it across our teams, and produce through our network of 21 vendors across three states.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q"><span>How do I start a project?</span><span class="plus">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Call, WhatsApp, or email — tell us the brief, and we'll take it from there.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

